  "description": "Minimal Cowboy is a bold western display font inspired by classic American cowboy typography, vintage western posters, and old frontier signage. Its strong slab-serif structure, rugged proportions, and distinctive western character give your designs an authentic cowboy and Old West atmosphere.\nThis font is perfect for creating eye-catching western logos, cowboy branding, vintage posters, rodeo designs, country graphics, t-shirt designs, badges, labels, packaging, signage, apparel, merchandise, and social media artwork.",
